# Parameter-dependent Cauchy–Green calculus for the native threefold

The imported results identify the actual integral with a solution in the
integrated complex coordinate, prove recovery for compactly supported data,
and prove commutation with every antiholomorphic parameter direction.  They
also establish the product rules and genuine mixed-derivative symmetry for
the original full antiholomorphic differential.
